# All knobs at both ends (super ignores filter and resonance), very low and very high notes, a velocity-1 note,
# fast knob jumps and a pitch bend on a wildly detuned high note.
tempo 120
steps 16
tail 0.3
track lead
preset 255 255 0 0 255 0 0 0 0 255 128 255 0 0 0 0 0 0
note 0 C0 4 127
note 4 C8 4 127
param p1 0 8
param p2 0 8
note 8 C2 4 1
param p1 255 12
param p2 255 12
note 12 G7 4 127
bend 12 200
expect peak_below -2
